{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 1. Overall Experience\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Hi, I\u8217'm Nikhil Karmare, and I explored the website. Overall, I found it useful for farmers looking to buy a tractor.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 2. Issues and Suggestions\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 One problem I noticed is that first-time buyers might find it difficult to choose the right tractor because there are many models and technical specifications. A simple recommendation feature based on farm size, crop type, and budget would make the process easier.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 3. Positive Aspects\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 What I liked most was the tractor comparison feature, which helps users compare different models in one place. The organized layout also makes tractor information easier to explore.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 I also liked how users can check important tractor details before making a decision.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 4. Overall Feedback\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Overall, the website is useful, and adding personalized recommendations could make the buying experience even smoother for farmers.\par}
